      4
     ],
     "display_name": "Pisces",
     "sprite": "pisces",
     "observe": "Thin, immaculate, hungry in a way food will not fix. He holds himself like a duelist and watches hands, not faces. Whatever he studies, it is not small.",
     "friendly_line": "A sniff - though a fractionally warmer one. You are... tolerable company. Rarer praise than you comprehend. I shall permit you to remain within conversational range.",
     "facing": "left",
     "talk_pool": [
      "You linger. Either you have a question of substance or you are another gawker. I shall assume the former. Generously.",
      "Magic is not the wand-waving the market storytellers sell. It is discipline. Precision. Neither, I observe, is common here.",
      "Yes, a [Necromancer]. No, I will not apologize for a competence others lack the wit to appreciate.",
      "A thin sniff. Do continue standing there. I find the silence rather more edifying than most conversation."
     ],
     "conversation": "pisces_magic",
     "dialogue": [
